          <td><strong>Fever</strong></td>
          <td>Low-grade or absent</td>
          <td>Common, often high (100–104°F)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Body aches</strong></td>
          <td>Mild, if any</td>
          <td>Often severe and widespread</td>
