          <td>1–3 days (GI symptoms)</td>
          <td>5–7 days (worst symptoms), fatigue can last 2–3 weeks</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>How it spreads</strong></td>
          <td>Contaminated food/water, surfaces, person-to-person (fecal-oral)</td>
